---
source: crates/m2-server-core/tests/items.rs
expression: h.log
---
-- bob sees alice's gear; alice takes the blade off: it goes to the first free place
@1000 conn#2 sends UseItem 1:94
   -> send conn#2 EntityUpdate vid=2 parts=[3003, 0, 0, 0] speed=165/100
   -> send conn#4 EntityUpdate vid=2 parts=[3003, 0, 0, 0] speed=165/100
   -> send conn#2 PointsChanged 17=100
   -> send conn#2 ItemSet 1:94 empty
   -> send conn#2 ItemSet 1:4 3001x1
-- and puts it back on
@1000 conn#2 sends UseItem 1:4
   -> send conn#2 EntityUpdate vid=2 parts=[3003, 3001, 0, 0] speed=165/110
   -> send conn#4 EntityUpdate vid=2 parts=[3003, 3001, 0, 0] speed=165/110
   -> send conn#2 PointsChanged 17=110
   -> send conn#2 ItemSet 1:4 empty
   -> send conn#2 ItemSet 1:94 3001x1
-- the wood blade goes on; the iron blade takes its place
@1000 conn#2 sends UseItem 1:3
   -> send conn#2 EntityUpdate vid=2 parts=[3003, 3008, 0, 0] speed=165/100
   -> send conn#4 EntityUpdate vid=2 parts=[3003, 3008, 0, 0] speed=165/100
   -> send conn#2 PointsChanged 17=100
   -> send conn#2 ItemSet 1:3 empty
   -> send conn#2 ItemSet 1:94 3008x1
   -> send conn#2 ItemSet 1:3 3001x1
-- refused with a line: the long blade's level, the hat's class; in silence: a potion at full health, an empty place, another window
@1000 conn#2 sends UseItem 1:2
   -> send conn#2 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "You need level 5 to wear this."
@1000 conn#2 sends UseItem 1:1
   -> send conn#2 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "Your character cannot wear this."
@1000 conn#2 sends UseItem 1:0
@1000 conn#2 sends UseItem 1:44
@1000 conn#2 sends UseItem 2:2
